      "parent": "s1",
      "stage": "s1",
      "meshName": "Booster_Engines",
      "explodeOffset": [0, -1.2, 0],
      "info": {
        "summary": "Nine Merlin 1D engines: eight in a ring around a centre engine, in a structure called the octaweb.",
        "purpose": "Burn RP-1 kerosene with liquid oxygen. Some can be relit several times, which is what makes landing possible: three for the boostback and entry burns, one for the landing burn.",
        "specs": {
          "Engines": "9 × Merlin 1D",
          "Thrust at liftoff": "7,607 kN total (about 845 kN each)"
        },
        "funFact": "The engines are throttleable. Even so, one Merlin at its lowest setting is more than the near-empty booster weighs, so it can't hover. The landing burn has to reach zero speed exactly at the ground."
